  "summary_en": "Opinion of the EU Committee of the Regions on the Commission's AI Continent Action Plan, setting out the role of local and regional authorities in AI gigafactory siting, data, procurement, sandboxes, skills, funding and AI Act implementation support. It has no robotics content.",
